Z||000015||The Fieromaster||06-28-2001||04:49 PM||||When I had my Eclipse we all went to Quaker Steak and Lube in a huge group allot of the guys were pulling monster HP and low 1/4 times (like 10's) and I will tell you what... Although my GSX had monster potential being awd and all.. the thing handled like $hit!!!!  My 16 year old Fiero handles better with stock bushings and no sway bar did.. thats sad seing that my Eclipse was a 97 with NO miles and supposed "wicked race suspension" compaired to my Fiero with its  "chevette" suspension!  Whatever to the $hit talking rice boys whos cars have all looks no balls!!<P>------------------<BR>      "Raced That Wrecked Better"<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://www.askfelons.com/fieromaster/fieromastergif1.gif">    <BR>~In Memory Of Jesse Cesek~ 1980-2000<BR>1985 GT ~Purple, Black and Yellow Interior(Fastback Converted)<BR>1997 Mitsu Eclipse GSX (AWD, Turbo) DOA on 12/10/2000||||reg||1
