Z||000021||banditbalz||06-28-2001||10:33 PM||||I have a friend with a '97 Prelude with a five speed and a header (non VTEC, 170hp i think). One night last summer we just left the local car show and we happened upon a set of lights. The race was over in 7 seconds, as i was doing over 60 mph in town by the time i shut her down, Zach was 3 car lentghs behind me...<BR>He had some lame ass excuse (as do all the imports i race)and wanted some more. He got spanked 4 more times that night.<BR>If it makes any difference, i have hundreds of quarter mile runs under my belt (a few trannies and clutches too). I have also taken a Prelude at the strip.<BR>Fast? i don't think so. <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/EatingRice.jpg">  <A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/banditbalz/" TARGET=_blank>www.geocities.com/banditbalz/</A> <P><P>------------------<BR>Silver 86 GT<BR>completely stock,<BR>completely fast!||||reg||12
